## Output

End your final message with exactly one `<drafts>…</drafts>` block holding this JSON and nothing else:

```json
{
  "drafts": [
    {
      "ref": "D1",
      "title": "…",
      "scope": ["…"],
      "done_when": ["…", {{ test_item | tojson }}],
      "depends_on": [],
      "estimate_h": 2,
      "review_required": false,
      "phase": {{ phase }}
    }
  ]
}
```

- 1 to 3 drafts, with refs `D1`, `D2`, `D3` in order.
- Every key is required except `depends_on` (default `[]`) and `review_required` (default `false`); no other keys.
- `scope` and `done_when` are non-empty lists of one-line strings.
